WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:03.548
Tomorrow, 8 AM. Meet on
Building B’s first floor.

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.026
Eight? Which building?

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.942
B. I’ll text the group.

4
00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.101
Got it. Thanks!

5
00:00:10.355 --> 00:00:14.232
See? There’s the
Vietnamese translation.

6
00:00:15.445 --> 00:00:18.177
Scan this code on the official site.

7
00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:21.689
Or look up the LINE account on screen.

8
00:00:24.355 --> 00:00:27.617
Add WanyuTong to the
group you want to use.

9
00:00:27.651 --> 00:00:31.661
Type and send @選單, as shown.

10
00:00:33.355 --> 00:00:36.204
See this card?

11
00:00:36.238 --> 00:00:38.845
Tap “語言設定” (Language Settings).

12
00:00:40.355 --> 00:00:43.771
We’ll pick Traditional
Chinese and Vietnamese.

13
00:00:43.805 --> 00:00:48.062
Pick the two languages
your group uses most.

14
00:00:50.445 --> 00:00:53.118
This message confirms the settings.

15
00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:55.911
Now send a message to try it out.

16
00:00:59.355 --> 00:01:03.537
The Vietnamese translation
is right below the Chinese.

17
00:01:03.571 --> 00:01:08.382
Check the time, building and floor.

18
00:01:16.355 --> 00:01:21.822
They reply in Vietnamese.
Read Chinese in the same group.

19
00:01:21.856 --> 00:01:26.444
The next day, they meet
at Building B at 8.

20
00:01:31.355 --> 00:01:36.022
At shift change, more staff
need to understand the notice.

21
00:01:37.355 --> 00:01:40.252
Tap “持續多語” (Multilingual Mode).

22
00:01:40.286 --> 00:01:44.201
Pick a preset or choose
your own languages.

23
00:01:48.355 --> 00:01:51.947
Put the language you use most first.

24
00:01:51.981 --> 00:01:55.790
Tap the button below to
see the other languages.

25
00:02:00.355 --> 00:02:04.254
When you tap, everyone
can see that translation.

26
00:02:04.288 --> 00:02:09.147
Tap again within 24 hours
without using more quota.

27
00:02:11.352 --> 00:02:13.983
Forgot which languages you set?

28
00:02:14.017 --> 00:02:16.494
Send @語言, as shown.

29
00:02:16.528 --> 00:02:20.664
Send @多語 關閉 to go
back to two languages.

30
00:02:21.355 --> 00:02:26.331
Take this example: A17,
before 2 PM, 12 boxes.

31
00:02:26.365 --> 00:02:31.745
Ask them to repeat it, then
check the label on site.

32
00:02:33.355 --> 00:02:37.867
A link or emoji alone won’t
auto-translate in the group.

33
00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:43.007
To tag a coworker, choose
them from LINE’s member list.

34
00:02:44.355 --> 00:02:48.714
What if a newcomer can’t find the menu?

35
00:02:48.748 --> 00:02:52.958
First, copy the text
attached to this card.

36
00:02:56.445 --> 00:02:58.905
Paste it back into the same group.

37
00:02:58.939 --> 00:03:04.482
Hold on phone, right-click on PC.
Choose “設為公告” (Pin).

38
00:03:08.445 --> 00:03:12.304
See the announcement
at the top of the chat?

39
00:03:14.355 --> 00:03:19.009
Reopen the menu. Choose
“已置頂，關閉提醒” to turn it off.

40
00:03:19.043 --> 00:03:24.090
The text won’t pop up next
time you open the menu.

41
00:03:27.355 --> 00:03:30.523
Need that text again later?

42
00:03:30.557 --> 00:03:34.861
Tap “恢復置頂提醒” (Restore
pin reminder) to bring it back.

43
00:03:37.355 --> 00:03:40.723
Want to check how many
translations you have left today?

44
00:03:40.757 --> 00:03:45.180
Go back to that group
and send @群組狀態.

45
00:03:47.445 --> 00:03:52.335
No quota if source & targets use
Chinese, EN, Japanese or Korean.

46
00:03:52.369 --> 00:03:57.287
Any other language? Count
each original message once.

47
00:03:57.321 --> 00:04:01.484
The group shares 50 messages a day.

48
00:04:03.355 --> 00:04:07.796
To upgrade, return to the
group you want to activate.

49
00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:13.184
Send @方案 and check the
price and the plan length.

50
00:04:18.355 --> 00:04:23.380
Wait for payment confirmation.
Check in the same group.

51
00:04:23.414 --> 00:04:29.419
Still inactive 5 minutes after
payment? Ask @客服 to check.

52
00:04:31.355 --> 00:04:37.105
Once voice is enabled, send a
voice note while moving stock.

53
00:04:37.139 --> 00:04:41.939
You’ll get a transcript and
translation. Check the key details.

54
00:04:43.355 --> 00:04:47.372
Take a clear photo of a shift
schedule like this and send it.

55
00:04:47.406 --> 00:04:51.993
Check names and times
against the original photo.

56
00:04:55.355 --> 00:05:00.478
New to AI Assistant?
Send @祕書 說明 for help.

57
00:05:00.512 --> 00:05:06.125
Check @祕書 狀態. Ask support
to enable logs or summaries.

58
00:05:09.445 --> 00:05:14.052
Use @祕書 摘要 to see
what still needs doing.

59
00:05:14.086 --> 00:05:18.285
For handover, use @祕書 報表
to sum up the day.

60
00:05:18.319 --> 00:05:21.432
If you’re unsure, go
back to the original.

61
00:05:23.355 --> 00:05:28.186
Send @歷史 in a direct chat
to find past translations.

62
00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:33.467
Need group chat logs? Ask
an admin to look them up.

63
00:05:38.355 --> 00:05:40.921
Huh? Why wasn’t this translated?

64
00:05:40.955 --> 00:05:44.518
First check that WanyuTong
is still in the group.

65
00:05:44.552 --> 00:05:49.257
Use @語言 and @群組狀態 to
check languages and usage.

66
00:05:50.355 --> 00:05:54.360
Check “最新公告” (Latest
Updates) for service changes.

67
00:05:54.394 --> 00:05:59.937
If the bot hasn’t replied, open this
page directly from the official site.

68
00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:05.372
Still stuck? Open the
support form with @客服.

69
00:06:05.406 --> 00:06:08.804
Tell us when it happened
and where you got stuck.

70
00:06:08.838 --> 00:06:12.668
If you attach an image, cover
any personal details first.

71
00:06:13.355 --> 00:06:17.065
Was that translation good?
Or was something off?

72
00:06:17.099 --> 00:06:20.637
Just send a thumbs-up or
thumbs-down on its own.

73
00:06:23.355 --> 00:06:27.502
Forgot the steps? Go back to @新手教學.

74
00:06:27.536 --> 00:06:32.040
Looking for a command? Send @說明.

75
00:06:37.355 --> 00:06:42.734
Try translating something people
usually say in your group.
